    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"ConfigureConsultationUI-PurposeandBenefits\">Purpose and Benefits</h2><p>The Consultation User Interface allows the User to:</p><ul><li>Capture observations about the patient.</li><li>Confirm or determine diagnoses and view past diagnoses (including X-rays, Documents, et al.) for the patient.</li><li>Make dispositions.</li><li>Enter consultation notes.</li><li>Create laboratory orders.</li><li>Order drugs and view past and active medications.</li><li>Create Bacteriology test orders.</li></ul><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image confluence-content-image-border image-center\" width=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014566/Consultation%20UI.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1447336906048&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=437\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/32014566/Consultation%20UI.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1447336906048&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"32604527\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Consultation UI.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"32014566\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"19\" data-media-id=\"805afe56-b1d7-4038-996f-7b9c2fe28e73\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014566/Consultation%20UI.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1447336906048&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1239&amp;height=774 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/32014566/Consultation%20UI.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1447336906048&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=700&amp;height=437 1x\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Consultation User Interface</strong></p><h2 id=\"ConfigureConsultationUI-Steps\">Steps</h2><p>The Consultation module is provided out-of-the-box (OOTB) with Bahmni. However, to further configure tabs for Consultation User Interface such as Observations, Diagnosis, etc. refer to the code snippet below:</p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"0cfc5a93-c5c3-4ca7-84c0-82bc1ddbf2a5\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">{\n  &quot;observations&quot;: {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;bahmni.clinical.consultation.observations&quot;,\n    &quot;extensionPointId&quot;: &quot;org.bahmni.clinical.consultation.board&quot;,\n    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;link&quot;,\n    &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Observations&quot;,\n    &quot;translationKey&quot;:&quot;OBSERVATIONS_BOARD_LABEL_KEY&quot;,\n    &quot;url&quot;: &quot;concept-set-group/observations&quot;,\n    &quot;default&quot;: true,\n    &quot;icon&quot;: &quot;fa-user-md&quot;,\n    &quot;order&quot;: 1,\n    &quot;requiredPrivilege&quot;: &quot;app:clinical:observationTab&quot;\n  },\n  &quot;diagnosis&quot;: {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;bahmni.clinical.consultation.diagnosis&quot;,\n    &quot;extensionPointId&quot;: &quot;org.bahmni.clinical.consultation.board&quot;,\n    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;link&quot;,\n    &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Diagnosis&quot;,\n    &quot;translationKey&quot;:&quot;DIAGNOSIS_BOARD_LABEL_KEY&quot;,\n    &quot;url&quot;: &quot;diagnosis&quot;,\n    &quot;icon&quot;: &quot;fa-user-md&quot;,\n    &quot;order&quot;: 2,\n    &quot;requiredPrivilege&quot;: &quot;app:clinical:diagnosisTab&quot;\n  },\n  &quot;disposition&quot;: {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;bahmni.clinical.consultation.disposition&quot;,\n    &quot;extensionPointId&quot;: &quot;org.bahmni.clinical.consultation.board&quot;,\n    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;link&quot;,\n    &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Disposition&quot;,\n    &quot;translationKey&quot;:&quot;DISPOSITION_BOARD_LABEL_KEY&quot;,\n    &quot;url&quot;: &quot;disposition&quot;,\n    &quot;icon&quot;: &quot;fa-user-md&quot;,\n    &quot;order&quot;: 3,\n    &quot;requiredPrivilege&quot;: &quot;app:clinical:dispositionTab&quot;\n  },</pre>\n</div></div><p>For further information refer to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/Bahmni/default-config/blob/master/openmrs/apps/clinical/extension.json\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Bahmni/default-config/blob/master/openmrs/apps/clinical/extension.json</a></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro has-no-icon confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"e7b3588e-96e1-4de3-a29d-46427cf35a1e\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"12bde249-f2a0-4e29-987a-ec64052de4d0\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"f5e76242-9ad1-477e-9fa2-70ff0a12c473\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #668D3C;color: white;\"><b>Feature Details</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37945475/Capturing+Consultation+Data\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37945475\" data-linked-resource-version=\"5\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Capturing Consultation Data - Feature Guide</a></span></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
